# Pinned upstream LarkAgentX files the bridge overrides or depends on.
# The vendored checkout lives at /opt/larkagentx/source on 47edge (outside this
# repo, like Spider_XHS for xhs-intel). The bridge's RecoveringLarkClient
# overrides behaviour here instead of editing these; a drift means an override
# (build_ws_url version spoof, _gateway_post headers, decode_push_messages cmd
# gating, pull_history, QrLogin) may silently break and must be re-reviewed.
# Regenerate after an intentional pin bump:
#   bash feishu-relay/scripts/edge/verify-larkx-pin.sh --update
